{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"so this is a note for DMs and Mods but I dont want to ping everyone:\n\nAll mods will be given a rank called GM.  this rank lets them assist in managing avrae's built in init tracker.  By using said tracker, it keeps init in a pinned message within discord, and avrae will ping people when its their init. itll take a little getting used to (for instance I have not figured out how to force something to go on a specific init yet, like make a creature whose init is always on 1 or set legendary actions for init 20).\n\nIn addition, there are 5 invitational ranks that when a dm sets players or mods to, will make them appear above mods in the person list, but will not change their color (so mods will still be red, players purple).  The idea is once you have a group for invitational/event, a DM can create a room, or lock a room to only allow dm's, bots, and people with the right invitational rank to be able to post in said room, or talk in an appropriate voice channel, and you can let everyone else live in read only mode (though id likely let them react casue its fun).\n\nOnce that group is done, the DM will need to remove the rank from those players and mods, and unlock any room that is approprate for players to now be able to interact with\n\nEdit: the command as lucky figured out is ```init add +20(as if that was the modifier) lair -p```","created_at":"2021-06-20T13:31:38.541000Z","edited_at":"2021-06-20T13:41:00.886000Z","id":"856164395033165824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
